char* allocate_buffer_and_write(size_t buf_size) {
    // Guideline 1: Validate and limit input dimensions, sizes, and parameters.
    // The function requires writing to the "first 10 bytes" and "last 10 bytes".
    // If buf_size is less than 10, it's impossible to fulfill this requirement
